# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Radio-ish Lab — Season One
# Media blobs are NOT in git. 139 files exceed git's 100 MB hard limit and the
# project is ~97 GB; GitHub's practical ceiling is ~2 GB per repo. This repo
# tracks the release METADATA: structure, press copy, QC evidence, checksums
# and the reproducible build pipeline. Masters stay on local/backup storage.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# audio
*.wav
*.aiff
*.aif
*.aifc
*.flac
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.ogg
*.opus

# video
*.mov
*.mp4
*.m4v
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm
*.prproj

# session/tooling noise
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.log
node_modules/

# heavy working directories (masters, stems, raw footage, platform uploads)
# NOTE: leading "/" is required. An unanchored "SDKZ/" would also match
# Season One/Artists/SDKZ/ and hide the release tree from git.
/Social_Media/*/Bandcamp/
/Social_Media/*/Mixcloud/
/Social_Media/*/SoundCloud/
/Social_Media/*/Instagram/
/Social_Media/*/Tracksource/
/Social_Media/promo/*/*.mp4
/Social_Media/promo/*/*.mov

# per-artist working folders — the ~97 GB of source of truth.
# Their press copy + QC is mirrored under Season One/Artists/<Artist>/.
/SDKZ/
/Yogo/
/Bernie/
/Mundz/
/Maya/
/Dikier/
/DJ Unknown/
/Alexander Zwo/
/Habib/
/Parisa/
/El Djemba/
/Schrödinger’s Breakfast/

# shared session projects
/radio-ish 2 Project/
/radioish Project/
/Advertising/
/Archive/
/_qc_tmprender/

# .gitignore itself must not be re-ignored
!.gitignore

# NOTE: do NOT blanket-ignore EPK_Project/ or QC_Reports/ — those hold the
# per-artist text/QC records that this repo exists to publish.
